<title>ROMANIA: Romania January jobless rate 6.7 pct vs 6.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Romania January jobless rate 6.7 pct vs 6.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's jobless rate rose slightly to 6.7 percent in January from 6.1 percent at end-1996, the Labour Ministry reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>Romania's workforce is 10.491 million.</p>
<p>				  JANUARY    DECEMBER  JAN 1996</p>
<p> Number unemployed	  702,537    639,177   1.042 million</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	    6.7	    6.1	9.3</p>
<p>NOTE -- Ministry data showed counties in north-east Romania had the highest unemployment rate -- of about 11 percent. They showed half the total number of jobless people were women.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
